{% extends 'base.jinja' %}
{% block content %}
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
  <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: March 2026</p>
  <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect information you provide when registering (name, email, phone), booking pandits (address, puja details), and uploading profile information. We also collect usage data automatically.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>Your information is used to facilitate bookings, send confirmations, improve our services, and communicate with you about your account. We do not sell your personal data.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">3. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We use industry-standard security measures to protect your data. However, no internet transmission is 100% secure. Use a strong password and keep it confidential.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">4. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use session cookies for login functionality. We do not use tracking cookies or third-party advertising cookies.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">5. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You may request deletion of your account and personal data at any time by contacting support. We will process your request within 30 days.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">6. Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy concerns, email <a href="mailto:privacy@sdonlinepanditjee.com" class="text-brand-600 underline">privacy@sdonlinepanditjee.com</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
